  "notes": "## 0.20.0-alpha.4 - 2026-07-26\n\n### Features\n\n- Clarify the device connection options by distinguishing regular device pairing from connecting a phone over LAN (#1439)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- Fix the app opening to a blank window on macOS 12.5, which is now the minimum supported macOS version (#1431)\n- Fix `uniclip get --type` failing to find image and file entries (#1436)\n- Restore automatic update checks after the initial setup is complete (#1437)\n\n<!-- zh -->\n\n## 0.20.0-alpha.4 - 2026-07-26\n\n### Features\n\n- 明确区分常规设备配对与通过局域网连接手机，让设备连接选项更清晰 (#1439)\n\n### Fixes\n\n- 修复应用在 macOS 12.5 上启动后显示空白页面的问题，并将 macOS 12.5 设为最低支持版本 (#1431)\n- 修复 `uniclip get --type` 无法找到图片和文件条目的问题 (#1436)\n- 修复初始设置完成后自动更新检查未能运行的问题 (#1437)",
